motivation: Start with the smallest stone. The wall gets built whether you feel like lifting.
discipline: Motivation is a guest. Discipline pays the rent every single month.
money: Save like patience is interest. Spend like ownership is the point.
mindset: You are not behind. You are just taking the next step differently.
fact: A day on Venus lasts longer than its year.
books: Deep work is a skill that must be trained, not a talent you either have or lack.
stoic: Your mind takes the color of what you keep returning to. Choose the return.
